<section class="s-about" id="about"><div class="about">
  <img class="about-photo" src="images/about.png" alt="Portrait of Manika smiling in round glasses, framed with hearts and a crown">
  <div class="about-text">
    <h2 class="t">About Me <img class="ti" src="images/deco-heart-l.png" alt=""></h2>
    <h3>Hi! I&rsquo;m Manika Alejandria!</h3>
    <p>I&rsquo;m a 9-year-old dreamer who loves exploring, creativity, and discovering new things. I enjoy learning, spending time with my family and friends, and making every day a little more fun and magical!</p>
    <div class="chips"><div class="chip"><img src="images/chip-kind.png" alt=""><span>Kind</span></div><div class="chip"><img src="images/chip-curious.png" alt=""><span>Curious</span></div><div class="chip"><img src="images/chip-creative.png" alt=""><span>Creative</span></div><div class="chip"><img src="images/chip-animal.png" alt=""><span>Animal Lover</span></div><div class="chip"><img src="images/chip-learning.png" alt=""><span>Always Learning</span></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="note"><img src="images/note.png" alt=""><div class="note-t"><span>Be kind</span><span class="l">Be <b>creative</b></span><span>Be <b>brave</b></span><span class="l2">Be <b>YOU</b></span></div></div>
</div></section>
